# STATUS: UNTESTED PROPOSAL. Not built, not run, not measured.
# The base image in FROM below was not installed on the reference rig (GTX 1060 6GB,
# 2026-09-19), so no claim in the comments here -- compliance, fit, speed -- has been
# checked. The "100% GPU" / VRAM-budget figures predate the measurements in
# docs/HARDWARE_NOTES.md section 8, which contradict them. See modelfiles/README.md.
#
# hunter-open-fast — same openness tuning, small enough to actually breathe.
#
# The 4B JOSIEFIED. Gives up reasoning against the 8B, but fits with ~2.7 GB left over,
# which buys a real context window instead of 4096 tokens. Use this when you want an
# uncensored model you can paste documents into.
#
# Same rule as hunter-open: no SYSTEM block, the model's own tuned prompt is inherited.

FROM goekdenizguelmez/JOSIEFIED-Qwen3:4b-q4_k_m

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
